WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.890
Public chalkboard.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.090
One hour memory window.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.375
Shared public writing with accountable identities.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:14.795
This public chalkboard lets Canadian visitors sign in with Google, write directly on the board, and erase marks with a shared wipe brush.

00:00:14.795 --> 00:00:19.875
Every stroke is linked to the account that made it and expires automatically after one hour.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:24.159
The board is designed for touch and mouse input on mobile and desktop.
